msgid "Upload an image or a video."
msgstr "Rasm yoki video yuklang."

msgid "Unsupported video format. Allowed: MP4, MOV, WEBM, M4V."
msgstr "Video formati qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi. Ruxsat etilgan: MP4, MOV, WEBM, M4V."

msgid "The video is too large (maximum 100 MB)."
msgstr "Video hajmi juda katta (eng ko'pi 100 MB)."

msgid "The video is too long (maximum 120 seconds)."
msgstr "Video juda uzun (eng ko'pi 120 soniya)."

msgid "The video could not be processed. Upload a valid video file."
msgstr "Videoni qayta ishlab bo'lmadi. To'g'ri video fayl yuklang."

msgid "Video processing is not available: ffmpeg is not installed on the server."
msgstr "Videoni qayta ishlash mavjud emas: serverda ffmpeg o'rnatilmagan."

msgid "MP4/MOV/WEBM, up to 120 seconds, up to 100 MB. The poster is created automatically."
msgstr "MP4/MOV/WEBM, 120 soniyagacha, 100 MB gacha. Poster avtomatik yaratiladi."

msgid "Upload an image or a video. For a video the poster is created automatically; upload an image only to use your own poster."
msgstr "Rasm yoki video yuklang. Video uchun poster avtomatik yaratiladi; o'z posteringizni ishlatish uchun rasm yuklang."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Ko'rinish"

